<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21206] LFU: keep the scan API private for 2.18</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21206</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;2.18.x is a long-term support release, so every public interface added in 2.18 has to be kept for years.  The LFU changes for 2.18 currently add seven public functions to liblustreapi, each with a man page:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_scan_namespace()&lt;/tt&gt; (landed in 2.17.5x, &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20603" title="LFU: llapi namespace scanner API emitting per-object records to a consumer callback" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20603"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20603&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_scan_device()&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;llapi_find_device()&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20611" title="Utils: lfs find over a Lustre target, read from its device" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20611"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20611&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_scan_rec_path()&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20637" title="LFU: Output Format module to generate pathnames from FIDs" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20637"&gt;LU-20637&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_scan_changelog()&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;llapi_scan_fid()&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20649" title="llapi: read an MDT changelog as a stream of scan records" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20649"&gt;LU-20649&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;tt&gt;llapi_find_since()&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20650" title="LFU: lfs find --since and --changelog, the changelog as a find source" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20650"&gt;LU-20650&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;lfs find&lt;/tt&gt; needs only one interface, &lt;tt&gt;llapi_find()&lt;/tt&gt; with &lt;tt&gt;struct find_param&lt;/tt&gt;, which predates 2.18.  The one new public scan interface in 2.18 should be the LFU Object Stream (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20730" title="LFU: llapi_scan_mount() to scan a filesystem's MDTs from a client" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20730"&gt;LU-20730&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;llapi_lfu_*()&lt;/tt&gt;), so that tools such as lfu-purge and lfu-resync do not start on a per-object interface that is then replaced.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Plan, after the 2.18 LFU changes land and before 2.18.0:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_find()&lt;/tt&gt; reads a target when &lt;tt&gt;fp_device&lt;/tt&gt; is set, and the changelog when &lt;tt&gt;fp_since_kind&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;fp_changelog_mdt&lt;/tt&gt; or &lt;tt&gt;fp_since_cookie&lt;/tt&gt; is set; otherwise it walks as today.  &lt;tt&gt;lfs find&lt;/tt&gt; calls only &lt;tt&gt;llapi_find()&lt;/tt&gt;, and the &lt;tt&gt;--bookmark&lt;/tt&gt; file is read and written by the library.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The seven functions become internal (renamed, declared in an internal header, not exported by &lt;tt&gt;liblustreapi.so&lt;/tt&gt;); their man pages are removed, and &lt;tt&gt;llapi_find.3&lt;/tt&gt; describes the new &lt;tt&gt;find_param&lt;/tt&gt; fields.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The scan tests reach the internal functions through a convenience library, so they still build with &lt;tt&gt;--disable-static&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Nothing visible to &lt;tt&gt;lfs find&lt;/tt&gt; users changes.  A prototype passes conf-sanity 300a-306 and sanity 56Ee, 56Eea and 160Aa-160Af.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
